These files (`dnabert2_library.npz`, `dnabert2_rs241.npz`) are frozen
embeddings extracted by running `zhihan1996/DNABERT-2-117M` on CROSSHOST's
regulatory sequence library. DNABERT-2's source repository
(github.com/MAGICS-LAB/DNABERT_2) is Apache-2.0 licensed [VERIFIED via
GitHub API, Gate 8 packaging] — permissive, commercial use allowed with
attribution. Kept in a separate directory from data/core/ (MIT) for
provenance clarity, not because of a use restriction like PromoGen2's.

Note: the HuggingFace model card itself (huggingface.co/zhihan1996/DNABERT-2-117M)
does not carry a `license` tag; Apache-2.0 was confirmed from the source
GitHub repository, which is the authoritative statement of terms. If you
plan to redistribute these embeddings commercially, verify this against the
model authors directly rather than relying solely on this note.
